            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# CodexMate 0.0.34

- Keeps the menu bar unread indicator aligned with the threads that are actually visible in the menu.
- Restores visible menu entries for listed Codex sessions whose workspace folder still exists even when the project catalog has not recorded that root.
- Keeps removed or missing workspace folders hidden so stale project roots do not reappear.
]]></description>
